Legal finance automation triggers and schedule
title end

paragraph start
An automation starts from a trigger, such as a deadline date, a new invoice or a monthly review. Only repeatable steps are automated.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Each automation is written with its trigger, steps, schedule and the person who checks the result.
paragraph end

